#: ../../tools/hvmcli/virtswitch.rst:2
msgid "virtswitch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/virtswitch.rst:4
msgid ""
"Manage Virtual Switches on the HVM host. Virtual Switches abstract host-"
"level networking (bonds, bridges, VLANs) into a simple management model."
msgstr "Gerencie Virtual Switches no host HVM. Virtual Switches abstraem o networking em nível de host (bonds, bridges, VLANs) em um modelo de gerenciamento simples."

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/virtswitch.rst:6
msgid "Danger"
msgstr "Perigo"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/virtswitch.rst:6
msgid ""
"Direct use of ``hvmcli virtswitch`` commands can disrupt host networking "
"and cause loss of connectivity. It is **highly recommended** to manage "
"Virtual Switches through the Morpheus UI (Infrastructure > Clusters > "
"Network > Virtual Switches) instead. Only use these CLI commands when "
"directed by HPE support or when the Morpheus UI is unavailable."
msgstr "O uso direto dos comandos ``hvmcli virtswitch`` pode interromper o networking do host e causar perda de conectividade. É **altamente recomendado** gerenciar Virtual Switches pela UI do Morpheus (Infrastructure > Clusters > Network > Virtual Switches). Use esses comandos da CLI somente quando orientado pelo suporte HPE ou quando a UI do Morpheus estiver indisponível."

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/virtswitch.rst:8
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/virtswitch.rst:8
msgid ""
"The ``virtswitch`` namespace is only available on **HVM OS Ubuntu "
"26.04+** with **Cluster Layout 2.0**. On HVM OS Ubuntu 24.04, this "
"namespace is hidden and unavailable."
msgstr "O namespace ``virtswitch`` só está disponível no **HVM OS Ubuntu 26.04+** com **Cluster Layout 2.0**. No HVM OS Ubuntu 24.04, este namespace fica oculto e indisponível."

